---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site.js';
---
<Page title="Affiliate Disclosure" description={`How ${SITE.name} earns money from affiliate links.`}>
  <p>{SITE.name} is reader-supported. Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, we may earn a commission from the retailer. You do not pay anything extra.</p>
  <p>Affiliate relationships never change a calculator's result. Our calculators work the same whichever brand you end up choosing, and we recommend product sizes based on your numbers, not on commission rates.</p>
  <p>We may take part in affiliate programs run by retailers and brands that sell power stations, solar panels, batteries and related equipment, including through affiliate networks. Where a program requires a specific disclosure, we include it on the relevant page.</p>
  <p>This site may also show advertising served by third parties such as Google. See our Privacy Policy for how those ads use cookies.</p>
</Page>
